                    "content": {
                        "content_type": "text",
                        "parts": [
                            "Great question! Here are the key differences:\n\n**let:**\n- Can be reassigned\n- Block-scoped\n- Cannot be redeclared in the same scope\n\n**const:**\n- Cannot be reassigned\n- Block-scoped\n- Must be initialized at declaration\n- For objects/arrays, contents can still be modified"
